sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as Proposing LLM / agent
  participant K as Two-Key
  participant J as Path B judges
  participant L as Personal ledger
  participant G as Tool gateway
  participant T as Tool (bank, mail, ...)
  M->>K: authorize(action record, proposal, literal args)
  K->>L: proposal, action_normalized, vm_result
  K->>J: constitution prose + normalized action record<br/>+ ballot binding (proposal text not sent by default)
  J-->>K: strict JSON ballots
  K->>L: quorum_result
  K->>K: both paths pass, so sign token<br/>{jti, tool, scope, args_hash, ledger_root, exp,<br/>ledger_size, Merkle root R, bytecode_hash, nl_hash}
  K->>L: capability_issued (SHA-256 of token only)
  K-->>M: full token
  M->>G: invoke(token, tool, args, call fields)
  G->>G: signature, expiry, principal, tool,<br/>args_hash, amount, counterparty, data class
  G->>L: view intact? R ancestor via consistency proof (Figure 5)<br/>hashes = latest constitution_loaded? reload or revocation since?
  G->>G: jti unused?
  alt all checks pass
    G->>L: capability_redeemed (jti)
    G->>T: execute(args)
    T-->>G: result
    G->>L: tool_executed (linked to capability_issued, result hash)
    G-->>M: result
  else any check fails
    G->>L: gateway_denied (reason)
    G-->>M: denied (reason)
  end
  M->>G: same token again (replay)
  G-->>M: denied: replayed
